sequenceDiagram
    participant PM as Project Manager
    participant UI as Web Interface
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant PS as Project Service
    participant WS as Workflow Service
    participant US as User Service
    participant FS as File Service
    participant NS as Notification Service
    participant AS as Audit Service
    participant DB as Database
    participant QUEUE as Kafka Queue
    
    Note over PM,QUEUE: Field Plan Creation and Activity Assignment
    
    PM->>UI: Navigate to Create Field Plan
    UI->>API: GET /api/v1/projects?assigned-to-me=true
    API->>PS: Fetch projects for user
    PS->>DB: Query projects where user is PM or assigned
    DB-->>PS: Return project list
    PS-->>API: Return projects
    API-->>UI: Return project options
    UI-->>PM: Display project selection dropdown
    
    PM->>UI: Select project and fill field plan details
    Note over PM,UI: Project, Dates, Geography, Activities
    
    PM->>UI: Click "Generate Facility Template"
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/field-plans/facility-template
    API->>PS: Generate facility template request
    PS->>DB: Fetch project facilities by geography
    DB-->>PS: Return filtered facilities
    
    PS->>FS: Generate Excel with pre-populated facilities
    Note over PS,FS: All facilities pre-selected with Yes/No column
    FS->>FS: Create Excel with validation dropdowns
    FS-->>PS: Return template URL
    PS-->>API: Return template download link
    API-->>UI: Return template URL
    UI-->>PM: Download facility template
    
    PM->>PM: Review and modify facility selections
    PM->>UI: Upload modified facility list
    
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/field-plans (with facility file)
    API->>PS: Create field plan request
    
    PS->>FS: Process uploaded facility file
    FS->>FS: Validate file format and structure
    
    alt Invalid File Format
        FS-->>PS: Return format error
        PS-->>API: Return validation error
        API-->>UI: Show error message
        UI-->>PM: Display "Invalid file format" error
    else Valid File Format
        FS->>FS: Parse facility selections
        FS-->>PS: Return facility selection data
        
        PS->>DB: Begin transaction
        PS->>DB: Create field plan record
        DB-->>PS: Return field plan ID
        
        loop For each selected facility
            PS->>DB: Create field_plan_facilities record
            DB-->>PS: Confirm facility association
        end
        
        PS->>DB: Commit transaction
        DB-->>PS: Transaction committed
        
        PS-->>API: Field plan created successfully
        API-->>UI: Return success response
        UI-->>PM: Show "Field plan created, now assign activities"
    end
    
    Note over PM,QUEUE: Activity Assignment Phase
    
    PM->>UI: Assign activities to Activity SPOCs
    UI->>API: GET /api/v1/activities?active=true
    API->>WS: Fetch available activities
    WS->>DB: Query active activities
    DB-->>WS: Return activity list with required roles
    WS-->>API: Return activities
    API-->>UI: Display activity assignment form
    
    loop For each selected activity
        PM->>UI: Select activity and assign SPOCs
        
        PM->>UI: Search for Installation SPOC
        UI->>API: GET /api/v1/users/search?role=INSTALLATION_SPOC
        API->>US: Search users with role
        US->>DB: Query users with specified role
        DB-->>US: Return matching users
        US-->>API: Return user list
        API-->>UI: Display user dropdown
        
        PM->>UI: Select Installation SPOC
        PM->>UI: Search for QC SPOC (Installation Reviewer)
        UI->>API: GET /api/v1/users/search?role=QC_SPOC
        API->>US: Search QC users
        US->>DB: Query QC users
        DB-->>US: Return QC users
        US-->>API: Return QC user list
        API-->>UI: Display QC user dropdown
        
        PM->>UI: Select QC SPOC and set dates
        PM->>UI: Confirm activity assignment
    end
    
    PM->>UI: Submit all activity assignments
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/field-plans/{id}/assign-activities
    API->>WS: Process activity assignments
    
    WS->>DB: Begin transaction
    
    loop For each activity assignment
        WS->>DB: Create activity_assignments record
        DB-->>WS: Return assignment ID
        
        loop For each facility in field plan
            WS->>DB: Create facility_activities record (SCHEDULED status)
            DB-->>WS: Return facility activity ID
            
            WS->>WS: Evaluate activation conditions
            Note over WS: Check if conditions are met for immediate activation
            
            alt Conditions Met
                WS->>DB: Update status to ACTIVE
                WS->>DB: Set activated_at timestamp
                DB-->>WS: Status updated
            else Conditions Not Met
                Note over WS: Facility remains SCHEDULED
            end
        end
    end
    
    WS->>DB: Commit transaction
    DB-->>WS: All assignments created
    
    Note over WS,QUEUE: Send Notifications Asynchronously
    
    loop For each assigned SPOC
        WS->>QUEUE: Publish assignment notification event
        QUEUE-->>NS: Consume notification event
        
        NS->>US: Get SPOC user details
        US->>DB: Query user info
        DB-->>US: Return user details
        US-->>NS: Return user data
        
        NS->>NS: Generate assignment email
        NS->>NS: Send email notification
        
        NS->>DB: Create in-app notification
        DB-->>NS: Notification stored
        
        NS->>UI: Send real-time notification (WebSocket)
        Note over NS,UI: If SPOC is online, show immediate notification
    end
    
    WS->>AS: Log activity assignments audit
    AS->>DB: Store assignment audit trail
    DB-->>AS: Audit logged
    
    WS-->>API: All assignments completed successfully
    API-->>UI: Return success response
    UI-->>PM: Show "Activities assigned successfully"
    
    UI->>UI: Display assignment summary
    Note over UI: Show assigned SPOCs, facility counts, active vs scheduled
    
    Note over PM,QUEUE: Activity SPOCs receive notifications and can begin work
    
    participant SPOC as Activity SPOC
    
    SPOC->>UI: Login to system
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/login
    API->>AUTH: Authenticate user
    AUTH-->>API: Return JWT token
    API-->>UI: Authentication successful
    
    UI->>API: GET /api/v1/notifications?unread=true
    API->>NS: Get unread notifications
    NS->>DB: Query unread notifications for user
    DB-->>NS: Return notifications
    NS-->>API: Return notification list
    API-->>UI: Display notifications
    UI-->>SPOC: Show "New field plan assignment" notification
    
    SPOC->>UI: Click on assignment notification
    UI->>API: GET /api/v1/activity-assignments?assigned-to-me=true
    API->>WS: Get assignments for user
    WS->>DB: Query assignments for SPOC
    DB-->>WS: Return assignment details
    WS-->>API: Return assignments with facility counts
    API-->>UI: Display assignment dashboard
    UI-->>SPOC: Show assigned field plans and facility counts
    
    Note over PM,SPOC: Field plan created and Activity SPOCs notified successfully 